{
  "schemaVersion": "1.1.0",
  "id": "alerting-first-rule-set-evaluation-behavior",
  "title": "Set evaluation behavior",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Create an evaluation group that runs once a minute, then set how long a problem must last before the alert fires and how long it keeps firing after the condition resolves."
    },
    {
      "type": "interactive",
      "action": "highlight",
      "reftarget": "[data-testid=\"data-testid radio-button-option group-based\"] + label",
      "content": "If evaluation modes are shown, select **Use groups (Legacy)**.",
      "skippable": true,
      "requirements": [
        "on-page:/alerting/new/alerting",
        "exists-reftarget"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Create the one-minute evaluation group and set the alert timing."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "set-evaluation-behavior",
      "title": "Set evaluation behavior",
      "requirements": [
        "on-page:/alerting/new/alerting"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "content": "Click **New evaluation group**, name it `QuickPizza evaluation`, set **Evaluation interval** to `1m`, and click **Create**.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/alerting"
          ],
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "[data-testid=\"data-testid alert-rule new-evaluation-group-button\"]",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/alerting/new/alerting",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "[data-testid=\"data-testid alert-rule new-evaluation-group-name\"]",
              "targetvalue": "QuickPizza evaluation",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/alerting/new/alerting",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "[data-testid=\"data-testid alert-rule new-evaluation-group-interval\"]",
              "targetvalue": "1m",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/alerting/new/alerting",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "[data-testid=\"data-testid alert-rule new-evaluation-group-create-button\"]",
              "requirements": [
                "on-page:/alerting/new/alerting",
                "exists-reftarget"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "doIt": false,
          "reftarget": "[data-testid=\"data-testid alert-rule group-picker\"]:has(input[name=\"group\"][value=\"QuickPizza evaluation\"])",
          "content": "Confirm **QuickPizza evaluation** is selected.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/alerting",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "#eval-for-input",
          "targetvalue": "1m",
          "content": "Set **Pending period** to **1m** so the condition must stay true before the alert fires.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/alerting",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "#keep-firing-for-input",
          "targetvalue": "0s",
          "content": "Set **Keep firing for** to **0s** so the alert stops firing when the condition resolves.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/alerting/new/alerting",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Your evaluation schedule is set. Next, you configure no-data and error handling and choose a contact point."
    }
  ]
}
